> On Tue, Aug 12, 2014 at 12:13:54AM -0700, GameplaySearch wrote:
> > This query language parses a subset of English,
> > but can easily be extended to parse full-blown Lojban
>
> I believe that the very moment I see it.
> pe'i You're overly confident.
>
> It's _not_ easy to support the semantics of "full-blown Lojban".
> Otherwise lots of projects would do that already..
> There are some attempts out there, but well... To the best of my
> knowledge, they all fall short of various aspects.
>
>
> mi'e la .van. mu'o
>



